{"4731260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Way of the Warrior", "steam_appid": 4731260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Way of the Warrior is a souls-like PvP and boss rush game where you play as a samurai. Face other players in intense duels or fight a gauntlet of powerful warriors in a world inspired by feudal Japan. Parry, dodge, feint and attack until only one of you is left standing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731260/extras/5240e12cea43ea090e13be8d89cc08cb.poster.avif?t=1786113492\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731260/extras/5240e12cea43ea090e13be8d89cc08cb.webm?t=1786113492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731260/extras/5240e12cea43ea090e13be8d89cc08cb.mp4?t=1786113492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge other players to epic duels. Parry, dodge, feint and cut until one of you is victorious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731260/extras/b3c244876e2230062f663a602c8f77e5.poster.avif?t=1786113492\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731260/extras/b3c244876e2230062f663a602c8f77e5.webm?t=1786113492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731260/extras/b3c244876e2230062f663a602c8f77e5.mp4?t=1786113492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up and fight side by side with a friend. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731260/extras/f9e7d0e121ae5f5b25ebc56b2353755c.poster.avif?t=1786113492\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731260/extras/f9e7d0e121ae5f5b25ebc56b2353755c.webm?t=1786113492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731260/extras/f9e7d0e121ae5f5b25ebc56b2353755c.mp4?t=1786113492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel like a real samurai in the realistic gamemode, where one attack can be fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731260/extras/82de30478945c49498262a4c136cc002.poster.avif?t=1786113492\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731260/extras/82de30478945c49498262a4c136cc002.webm?t=1786113492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731260/extras/82de30478945c49498262a4c136cc002.mp4?t=1786113492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your build before every game. Find the one that suits you best or change up your build every match to confuse your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731260/extras/2acf2e1586fb448a21a73397580189e9.poster.avif?t=1786113492\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731260/extras/2acf2e1586fb448a21a73397580189e9.webm?t=1786113492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731260/extras/2acf2e1586fb448a21a73397580189e9.mp4?t=1786113492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight a series of powerful warriors in an epic gauntlet set in a world inspired by medieval Europe and feudal Japan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Way of the Warrior is a souls-like PvP and boss rush game where you play as a samurai. Face other players in intense duels or fight a gauntlet of powerful warriors in a world inspired by feudal Japan. Parry, dodge, feint and attack until only one of you is left standing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731260/extras/5240e12cea43ea090e13be8d89cc08cb.poster.avif?t=1786113492\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731260/extras/5240e12cea43ea090e13be8d89cc08cb.webm?t=1786113492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731260/extras/5240e12cea43ea090e13be8d89cc08cb.mp4?t=1786113492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge other players to epic duels. Parry, dodge, feint and cut until one of you is victorious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731260/extras/b3c244876e2230062f663a602c8f77e5.poster.avif?t=1786113492\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4731260/extras/b3c244876e2230062f663a602c8f77e5.webm